{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22283","headline":"病中逢秋招客夜酌 · 白居易","name":"病中逢秋招客夜酌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不见诗酒客，卧来半月余。\n合和新药草，寻检旧方书。\n晚霁烟景度，早凉窗户虚。\n雪生衰鬓久，秋入病心初。\n卧簟蕲竹冷，风襟邛葛疎。\n夜来身校健，小饮复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}